{"id":587,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This Pokémon absolutely loves sweet berries. Sometimes it stuffs its cheeks full of so much food that it can’t fly properly."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"As Emolga flutters through the air, it crackles with electricity. This Pokémon is cute, but it can cause a lot of trouble."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"As it flies, it scatters electricity around, so bird Pokémon keep their distance. That’s why Emolga can keep all its food to itself."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"They store up electricity to fly through the air. When thunder cracks at night, sometimes there are almost enough of them to blot out the sky."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It grills berries and bug Pokémon with electric shocks and makes a meal of them. It usually nests in the holes gouged in trees by Pikipek."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It glides using its cape-like membrane. Electrical energy scatters from it, shocking its friends and foes alike."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Black"],"text":"The energy made in its cheeks’ electric pouches is stored inside its membrane and released while it is gliding."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"They live on treetops and glide using the inside of a cape-like membrane while discharging electricity."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It glides on its outstretched membrane while shocking foes with the electricity stored in the pouches on its cheeks."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Static","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is charged with static electricity and may paralyze attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Motor Drive","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon takes no damage when hit by Electric-type moves. Instead, its Speed stat is boosted."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":587,"name":"Emolga","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,39],[1,609],[5,104],[10,98],[15,84],[20,268],[25,512],[30,209],[35,227],[40,521],[45,113],[50,435],[55,97]],"machine":[512,97,403,213,226,204,598,486,527,227,203,412,263,374,270,231,113,182,240,156,496,214,173,76,683,164,129,269,87,86,85,369,521,528],"egg":[310,343,432,355,351,321],"tutor":[814,804]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-112","name":"Emolga","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"112","artist":"Tomomi Ozaki","img":"zsv10pt5/112"},{"id":"me4-30","name":"Emolga","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Common","number":"30","artist":"Kazumasa Yasukuni","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-30/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-30/large"},{"id":"zsv10pt5-29","name":"Emolga","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Common","number":"29","artist":"Tomowaka","img":"zsv10pt5/29"},{"id":"sv6-69","name":"Emolga","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"69","artist":"Shimaris Yukichi","img":"sv6/69"},{"id":"swsh12pt5-47","name":"Emolga","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Common","number":"47","artist":"Saya Tsuruta","img":"swsh12pt5/47"},{"id":"swsh12-54","name":"Emolga","set":"Silver Tempest","date":"2022-11-11","rarity":"Common","number":"54","artist":"sowsow","img":"swsh12/54"},{"id":"swsh7-57","name":"Emolga","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"2021-08-27","rarity":"Common","number":"57","artist":"Nagomi Nijo","img":"swsh7/57"},{"id":"sm9-46","name":"Emolga","set":"Team Up","date":"2019-02-01","rarity":"Common","number":"46","artist":"Megumi Mizutani","img":"sm9/46"},{"id":"sm4-35","name":"Emolga","set":"Crimson Invasion","date":"2017-11-03","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"35","artist":"Kagemaru Himeno","img":"sm4/35"},{"id":"xy1-46","name":"Emolga-EX","set":"XY","date":"2014-02-05","rarity":"Rare Holo EX","number":"46","artist":"Eske Yoshinob","img":"xy1/46"},{"id":"xy1-143","name":"Emolga-EX","set":"XY","da